# Slice 8: the top bar with the LED dot of each layer, the backups menu with readable dates.
cli backup
ipc select caps
ipc assign esc
ipc drawer none
shot final
expect state-final.json .pending == 1 and .drawer == "none"
ipc menu backups
shot backups
ipc menu profiles
shot profiles
ipc menu none
ipc layer function2
shot fn2
